        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Narrow Style Stainless Steel European Cylinder Mortise Box,  AHI-EU2000</b>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Stainless Steel Faceplate and Strike plate:</b> Extremely resistant to corrosion, knocks, scratches and abrasion making it an ideal material for door hardware. It needs little looking after and does not degrade in appearance or function with use.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Mortise Lockcase:</b> Heavy gauge plated steel UL & ULC listed for custom residential, high traffic commercial, institutional and industrial uses where durability and security are of the greatest concern. Lock function for use with P series profile cylinders. UL-listed for 3 hours. UL label stamped on front (ULC available) UL sticker on case.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications:</b> for AHI EU2000 Stainless Steel European Cylinder Mortise Box<ul>\r\n<li>Mortise Case Faceplate: 1-1/4\" Stainless steel</li>\r\n<li>Latch Bolt: Zinc/Nickel Plated</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt:\tDie Cast Zinc/Nickel Plated</li>\r\n<li>Strike plate: Stainless steel 8.35\"H x 1.16\"W</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
